window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>My vampire men and I are stronger together. At least, we’re supposed to be.</b><br> </p> <p>The weird sisters got what they came for - a magical object that puts them one step closer to unleashing hell on earth. The cowardly king Carrick refuses to fight, which means it’s up to me and my men to stop them.<br> </p> <p>But after the attack on the Penumbra, I’m not sure I can. Malcolm is missing, and without him by my side, nothing feels right.<br> </p> <p>Somehow, these three lethally gorgeous vampire brothers have become like three parts of my soul, as necessary to my survival as the air I breathe. <br> </p> <p>Now I’m torn between my drive to hunt the sisters and my need to save one of the men I love.<br> </p> <p>Failing at either is not an option.<br> </p> <p>This is the final book in The Vampires' Fae trilogy, a reverse harem story intended for ages 18 and up. This book contains strong language, hot sex, and a heroine who refuses to choose between her men.</p>"; 
